{
  "server": "en",
  "storyId": "act17side_level_act17side_st03",
  "groupId": "act17side",
  "stageId": "act17side_03",
  "title": "Empty Street",
  "storyCode": "SN-ST-3",
  "avgTag": "Interlude",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/en/gamedata/story/activities/act17side/level_act17side_st03.txt",
  "sourceHash": "0e2d4bf80749a1b2957bf1be1d1118680162be0a9f2d6ff471a3138938115fa5",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "High Inquisitor",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_183#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Irene."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Inquisitor Irene",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4009_irene_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Yes, maestro... I mean, sir!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "High Inquisitor",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_183#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You seem distracted."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Inquisitor Irene",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4009_irene_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I... I'm fine."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "High Inquisitor",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_183#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Gran Faro is a tiny town, so small that most maps don't even bother to list it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "High Inquisitor",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_183#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "But this is a request from Lord Carmen himself, and it involves Dr. Kal'tsit and those Ægir."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Inquisitor Irene",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4009_irene_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I know, sir. I—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "High Inquisitor",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_183#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "If you still haven't found your answer, I will not give you permission to join the mission."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Inquisitor Irene",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4009_irene_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I'd already made up my mind when I first decided to follow in your footsteps and become an Inquisitor."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "High Inquisitor",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_183#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Yes, before you even knew the question. An answer is worthless if it cannot explain what you see and hear."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "High Inquisitor",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_183#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Don't die a worthless death, Irene. You know what we're fighting against. And you must find your own answer."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Inquisitor Irene",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4009_irene_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Inquisitor Irene",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4009_irene_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...Yes, sir."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gladiia",
      "speakerToken": "avg_474_gladiia_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Lady Kal'tsit."
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Gladiia's tone does not change, but her footsteps reflect her mood.\nA blink of the eye, and she is by Kal'tsit's side."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "Good work, Gladiia."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gladiia",
      "speakerToken": "avg_474_gladiia_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The Inquisition didn't do anything to you, did they?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "The fact that Iberia has not yet sunk into the sea is proof that they still retain a shred of humility and vigilance."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gladiia",
      "speakerToken": "avg_474_gladiia_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You found a way, as promised."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "Yes. However..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "Even if Iberia is willing to let go of their fears, what about Ægir?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "What about you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gladiia",
      "speakerToken": "avg_474_gladiia_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "If this temporary cooperation is necessary to help us return to the ocean... so be it."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2004_Alty",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Finally, an Ægir with some sense, right? Like the waves themselves, like the rays and texture of the sea."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2004_Alty",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Hello there, special Ægir. I believe you've already met our other members?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gladiia",
      "speakerToken": "avg_474_gladiia_1#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Yes. You're also a member of AUS?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2004_Alty",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Alty, bassist. Nice to meet you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2004_Alty",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "How are things outside?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gladiia",
      "speakerToken": "avg_474_gladiia_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The cultists are out in force, but individually they're rather weak."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gladiia",
      "speakerToken": "avg_474_gladiia_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "My Hunters can take care of everything."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "The Inquisition will only work with us once we've taken care of the problems in Gran Faro."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gladiia",
      "speakerToken": "avg_474_gladiia_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Then there's no time to waste."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Gladiia raises her lance.\nAt the same time, she senses that something is not right."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gladiia",
      "speakerToken": "avg_474_gladiia_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gladiia",
      "speakerToken": "avg_474_gladiia_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "There, among the Sea Terrors... but how could it be...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "Kal'tsit here."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elysium",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "Dr. Kal'tsit! Their goal is—"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "...Elysium?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gladiia",
      "speakerToken": "avg_474_gladiia_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What's the matter?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "One of our operators is in trouble."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gladiia",
      "speakerToken": "avg_474_gladiia_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Something lurks here."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "As we discussed, Alty, the members of AUS can stay ashore."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "We'll handle this as quickly as possible."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2004_Alty",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Sure, we can wait."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2004_Alty",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "And we'll be happy to provide some BGM for your campaign."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skadi",
      "speakerToken": "char_263_skadi#3",
      "operatorId": "char_263_skadi",
      "portraitKey": "char_263_skadi",
      "text": "...Too weak."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skadi",
      "speakerToken": "char_263_skadi#3",
      "operatorId": "char_263_skadi",
      "portraitKey": "char_263_skadi",
      "text": "They keep coming. Buying time?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skadi",
      "speakerToken": "char_263_skadi#8",
      "operatorId": "char_263_skadi",
      "portraitKey": "char_263_skadi",
      "text": "Or spreading... something."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skadi",
      "speakerToken": "char_263_skadi#8",
      "operatorId": "char_263_skadi",
      "portraitKey": "char_263_skadi",
      "text": "I must find the leader."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sea Terror",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_457_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "—Gkh—!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Specter",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1023_ghost2_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skadi",
      "speakerToken": "char_263_skadi#3",
      "operatorId": "char_263_skadi",
      "portraitKey": "char_263_skadi",
      "text": "Specter."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Specter",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1023_ghost2_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...Hm?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Specter",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1023_ghost2_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Ah... Skadi. Long time no see."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Specter",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1023_ghost2_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Something the matter?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skadi",
      "speakerToken": "char_263_skadi#5",
      "operatorId": "char_263_skadi",
      "portraitKey": "char_263_skadi",
      "text": "...Are you alright?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Specter",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1023_ghost2_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I'm fine, just a little tired."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Specter",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1023_ghost2_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Yes... We're fighting, right? The scent of the ocean... reminds me of home."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Specter",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1023_ghost2_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "But, home? My home... huh..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sea Terror",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_457_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Gkh—!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Specter",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1023_ghost2_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The sea."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Specter",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1023_ghost2_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The scent of the sea grows stronger. Are we home, Skadi? Is this the way home?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skadi",
      "speakerToken": "char_263_skadi#7",
      "operatorId": "char_263_skadi",
      "portraitKey": "char_263_skadi",
      "text": "...It will be, Specter. Laurentina. I promise."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Specter",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1023_ghost2_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Tell me then... what's that before my eyes?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skadi",
      "speakerToken": "char_263_skadi#9",
      "operatorId": "char_263_skadi",
      "portraitKey": "char_263_skadi",
      "text": "What?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "A figure strides down the street, humming a tune.\nThe streets are a mess in the aftermath of the panicking townsfolk, but it hardly bothers Frost as she plucks at the air and imagines music."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skadi",
      "speakerToken": "char_263_skadi#8",
      "operatorId": "char_263_skadi",
      "portraitKey": "char_263_skadi",
      "text": "Hmph!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sea Terror",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_457_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "(Slithering sounds)"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skadi",
      "speakerToken": "char_263_skadi#4",
      "operatorId": "char_263_skadi",
      "portraitKey": "char_263_skadi",
      "text": "The Sea Terrors keep away from her. No, they ignore her. Is she... playing an instrument?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Specter",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1023_ghost2_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Does it sound nice?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skadi",
      "speakerToken": "char_263_skadi#3",
      "operatorId": "char_263_skadi",
      "portraitKey": "char_263_skadi",
      "text": "I don't know."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Specter",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1023_ghost2_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Then ask."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skadi",
      "speakerToken": "char_263_skadi#6",
      "operatorId": "char_263_skadi",
      "portraitKey": "char_263_skadi",
      "text": "Wait!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elysium",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_450_1#12$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "*pant*... *pant*..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elysium",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_450_1#11$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "(Did I shake him?)"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elysium",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_450_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Dammit?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elysium",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_450_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Was it when we first met? No, he didn't even touch me."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ulpianus",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_445_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Those documents must be destroyed, Iberian."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ulpianus",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_445_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Obey, and you may keep your limbs. Attached, if you prefer."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elysium",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_450_1#12$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "(Shit, he's fast...)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elysium",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_450_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Weren't your friends only burning them because there wasn't time to save them all?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elysium",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_450_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "With your skills, you could just as easily have taken them yourself. So why the need to burn them?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ulpianus",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_445_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "'Friends?'"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The man growls from the bottom of his throat, a sound born of humiliation."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ulpianus",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_445_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "We are not 'friends.'"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elysium",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_450_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Then what?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ulpianus",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_445_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "It doesn't concern you. Surrender the documents, and leave this place."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ulpianus",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_445_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Whether you're with the Inquisition, or with another country..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ulpianus",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_445_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elysium",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_450_1#12$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "(He stopped.)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ulpianus",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_445_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Yes... you've always been sharp."
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The mysterious Ægir gazes into the distance.\n'Friends.'"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ulpianus",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_445_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "(Ægirian) We may be bound by blood, but you must stay away from Ægir for now."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elysium",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_450_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "—!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Elysium evades the attack, but it's immediately clear why he managed to.\nThe sword's aura rips the charred papers to shreds, sending the splintered truth drifting into the wind."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elysium",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_450_1#12$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Crap—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ulpianus",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_445_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "(Ægirian) They cannot return to Ægir just yet. Allowing everyone to act on their own will only accelerate the destruction."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ulpianus",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_445_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "(Ægirian) Even though Ægir has already chosen the path of self-annihilation."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Saint Carmen",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_447_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "No more Sea Terrors approach."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Saint Carmen",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_447_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Unsurprising numbers, for the coast. Now, where are you hiding?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wounded Cultist",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_454_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You... *cough* No! Not the lantern!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Saint Carmen",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_447_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Answer me. What do you intend for Gran Faro?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wounded Cultist",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_454_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "That lantern! Get it off me—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Saint Carmen",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_447_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Answer me."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wounded Cultist",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_454_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Ugh..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wounded Cultist",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_454_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "It... It's..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Saint Carmen",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_447_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What are you pointing at?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Carmen looks back in the direction that the cultist is indicating."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "A statue stands in the middle of the square."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Saint Carmen",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_447_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Ah."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Saint Carmen",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_447_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Gran Faro. The Great Lighthouse. Of course. You're seeking the lighthouse of Gran Faro."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wounded Cultist",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_454_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Stop... stop it... ugh..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Saint Carmen",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_447_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The nobles once called those great monuments the Eye of Iberia. Dozens of them once stood on Iberia's coastline."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Saint Carmen",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_447_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Even had the Witch King's Tower in Leithanien not been toppled, it would still have been dwarfed by these guardians of the sea."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Saint Carmen",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_447_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "They are the single greatest mark that human civilization has ever left on this land."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wounded Cultist",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_454_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The sea... *cough* the Eye of Iberia..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wounded Cultist",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_454_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The miracle... destroyed the sacrilege... argh... take that lantern away!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Saint Carmen",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_447_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The Profound Silence destroyed most of the lighthouses, and disabled the rest."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Saint Carmen",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_447_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What are you plotting?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wounded Cultist",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_454_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Saint Carmen",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_447_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I see. So you knew..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Saint Carmen",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_447_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You knew that one remained operational. That the goal of the Gran Faro project was to protect what was left of the Eye of Iberia."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Saint Carmen",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_447_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "That's why you've been lurking here, awaiting your chance."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wounded Cultist",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_454_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Saint Carmen",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_447_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I never expected there to be traitors in the very heart of the Inquisition. Where are they?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wounded Cultist",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_454_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Ha... hehehe..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wounded Cultist",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_454_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "While you're here... babbling away..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wounded Cultist",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_454_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Look under your feet... and come face to face... with your pathetic... narrow-mindedness..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Saint Carmen",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_447_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dying Sea Terror",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_457_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dying Sea Terror",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_457_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "(Unsettling slithering sounds)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Saint Carmen",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_447_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Hm."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Saint Carmen",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_447_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The Sea Terrors are... glowing?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Saint Carmen",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_447_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What is this luminescence?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "Get away from it!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Saint Carmen",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_447_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Ah—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "Mon3tr!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
      "speakerToken": "npc_10002",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "(Impatient growling)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "Meltdown."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
      "speakerToken": "npc_10002",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "(Agitated roars)"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Specter",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1023_ghost2_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Hello."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frost",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2003_Frost_1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "(Peaceful riff)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Specter",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1023_ghost2_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "There is a familiar scent on you... Do you know what it is?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frost",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2003_Frost_1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "(Spirited riff)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Specter",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1023_ghost2_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "A pleasant melody, but not the one that I know."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frost",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2003_Frost_1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Then, how does the one you know go?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Specter",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1023_ghost2_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "When she prayed, the stars ceased to shimmer♪\nWhen she wept, the night let out a smile♪\nWhen she laments, the anguish sprawled upon her madness♪"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frost",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2003_Frost_1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...A song of Ægir. A sad song."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frost",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2003_Frost_1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "But I don't like it. It belongs in the past. It lacks passion, and wallows in futile sentimentality—the same as Ægir itself."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Specter",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1023_ghost2_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "A shame."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frost",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2003_Frost_1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You've come home, Ægir."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Specter",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1023_ghost2_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Home? Me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frost",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2003_Frost_1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Sing."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frost",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2003_Frost_1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "In song, you will rediscover yourself."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Specter",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1023_ghost2_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Song?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Specter",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1023_ghost2_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What memories will singing recall?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frost",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2003_Frost_1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Just sing. You will encounter your past. You must eventually find and face your destiny, or it will find you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frost",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2003_Frost_1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "That's how it has ever been, since I left the ocean."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Specter",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1023_ghost2_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What a strange woman. But I don't mind singing."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Specter",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1023_ghost2_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Then sing."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Specter",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1023_ghost2_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "La la la, la la la♪"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Specter",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1023_ghost2_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "When she prays, the stars ceased to shimmer♪"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "......\n..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amaia",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_449_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "As always, there's such sorrow in your song."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Specter",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1023_ghost2_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Who are... you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amaia",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_449_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I never imagined we'd meet again in such circumstances, Laurentina."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
